tion to preserve equal-distance selection.\", \"Count selected labels in native char order, preserving unfilled sentinel labels when k exceeds the point count.\", \"Retain reference insertion as a fallback for NaN distances or scratch allocation failure; release temporary allocations after each call.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"cde95641e31d4132\", \"role\": \"C\", \"commit\": \"2e07504234fa9cd803c7c6d67108b1ebe406d7e9\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.17754479901244244, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Partition the original point traversal into balanced contiguous blocks using the runtime OpenMP team size, with the original insertion algorithm applied independently per block.\", \"Merge sorted local lists using strict distance comparisons and earlier-block precedence for ties, preserving sentinel padding when k exceeds the point count.\", \"Retain serial execution for small workloads, nested calls, unavailable OpenMP, NaN distances or scratch-allocation failure; release temporary storage after each call.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"18e847cfeeae47c9\", \"role\": \"A\", \"commit\": \"29568662504274e1d0448a46e29d2080f8414f6a\", \"mean_seconds\": 1.98599351507922, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Add a tail-first admission check that skips the forward candidate-buffer scan when the buffer is full and the new distance is at least its worst retained distance.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"5d756600c9124102\", \"role\": \"A\", \"commit\": \"f5f27fee0ae2b748f3a6c802937ff5f8bd7525d5\", \"mean_seconds\": 2.037849197474619, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/knn.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Compute squared distances for up to 256 consecutive points into a stack-resident tile, then apply the original neighbor-selection logic in traversal order.\"]}}]}, \"target_as_data\": {\"architecture\": \"ARM64\", \"cpu_cores\": 4, \"gpus\": 0}, \"required_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"analysis\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"A\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"B\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"C\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"G\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"analysis\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"G\"]}}"
